---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const timeline = [
  { week: 'Week 1-2', phase: 'Audit & strategy', desc: 'Ran the VITAL audit. Scored 42/100. Top leaks: Transition (32) and Automation (28). Built the prioritized 90-day plan.' },
  { week: 'Week 3-6', phase: 'Foundation rebuild', desc: 'Rebuilt the homepage and category pages for GEO. Added schema markup for Product, Organization, and FAQ entities. Set up proper attribution tracking.' },
  { week: 'Week 7-10', phase: 'Conversion optimization', desc: 'A/B tested 6 different CTAs, 4 hero variations, 2 booking flows. Booking rate improved 4.2x.' },
  { week: 'Week 11-13', phase: 'Scale & iterate', desc: 'Rolled out winning variants. Added 12 new category pages. Built the AI-overview citation monitor.' },
];
---

<Layout
  title="Tutti Rouge — Case study"
  description="How we helped Tutti Rouge go from VITAL 42 to 78 in 90 days. +187% organic traffic, 4.2x lead-to-customer, £2.1M attributed pipeline."
  active="/work"
>
  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="hero-section relative">
    <div class="container-wide">
      <a href="/work" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-[#888] hover:text-white mb-6">
        <i class="ph-bold ph-arrow-left"></i> All case studies
      </a>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4 text-xs mono text-[#888]">
        <span>Fashion resale</span>
        <span>·</span>
        <span>United Kingdom</span>
        <span>·</span>
        <span>2025</span>
      </div>
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <h1 class="text-display-1 text-white mb-5">
          Tutti Rouge — from invisible to <span class="text-gradient-brand">market leader</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="text-lg text-[#a0a0a0] leading-relaxed mb-6 max-w-2xl">
          A UK-based fashion resale brand rebuilding their entire acquisition engine around
          Generative Engine Optimization and conversion rate optimization. The result: +187%
          organic traffic, 4.2x lead-to-customer conversion, £2.1M attributed pipeline.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          {['SEO', 'GEO', 'Conversion', 'Analytics'].map((t) => (
            <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-[#1a1a1a] border border-[#2a2a2a] text-xs mono text-[#a0a0a0] rounded">{t}</span>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- KEY METRICS -->
  <section class="pb-16">
    <div class="container-wide">
      <div class="card p-10 grid md:grid-cols-4 gap-8">
        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow mb-2">VITAL Score</div>
          <div class="text-5xl font-black text-white mb-1">42 → 78</div>
          <div class="text-xs text-emerald-500">+36 points in 90 days</div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow mb-2">Organic traffic</div>
          <div class="text-5xl font-black text-white mb-1">+187%</div>
          <div class="text-xs text-[#666]">in 6 months</div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow mb-2">Conversion</div>
          <div class="text-5xl font-black text-white mb-1">4.2x</div>
          <div class="text-xs text-[#666]">lead-to-customer</div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow mb-2">Pipeline</div>
          <div class="text-5xl font-black text-[var(--color-brand)] mb-1">£2.1M</div>
          <div class="text-xs text-[#666]">attributed from organic</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- BACKGROUND -->
  <section class="section-y">
    <div class="container-wide grid lg:grid-cols-[1fr_2fr] gap-12">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow mb-3">Background</div>
        <h2 class="text-display-3 text-white">Who is Tutti Rouge?</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="space-y-4 text-lg text-[#a0a0a0] leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          Tutti Rouge is a UK-based fashion resale brand specializing in authenticated pre-owned
          luxury and contemporary pieces. Founded in 2019, they grew to £4M annual revenue
          primarily through Instagram and word-of-mouth.
        </p>
        <p>
          By late 2024, organic traffic had plateaued for 18 months. They were running Google
          Ads but couldn't attribute the leads. They had three different agencies working on
          different parts of the funnel — none of whom were talking to each other.
        </p>
        <p>
          The CEO reached out in January 2025 with one specific question: "Why is my competitor
          showing up in ChatGPT when someone asks about sustainable fashion in the UK, and I'm not?"
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- PROBLEM -->
  <section class="section-y bg-[#0c0c0c]">
    <div class="container-wide grid lg:grid-cols-[1fr_2fr] gap-12">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow mb-3">The problem</div>
        <h2 class="text-display-3 text-white">Where the leaks were</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="space-y-6">
        <p class="text-lg text-[#a0a0a0] leading-relaxed">
          The VITAL audit came back at <strong class="text-white">42/100</strong> — below average
          for the vertical. Two dimensions were critically low:
        </p>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          <div class="card p-6">
            <div class="text-3xl font-black text-[var(--color-brand)] mb-1">T: 32/100</div>
            <div class="font-bold text-white mb-2">Transition</div>
            <p class="text-sm text-[#888]">CTAs were buried below the fold. The booking form had 14 fields. Mobile checkout had 7 steps. Estimated 68% lead leakage.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card p-6">
            <div class="text-3xl font-black text-[var(--color-brand)] mb-1">A: 28/100</div>
            <div class="font-bold text-white mb-2">Automation</div>
            <p class="text-sm text-[#888]">No CRM. No retargeting. Email was a Mailchimp newsletter, not a nurture sequence. Visitors who didn\'t convert were lost forever.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- APPROACH -->
  <section class="section-y">
    <div class="container-wide grid lg:grid-cols-[1fr_2fr] gap-12">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow mb-3">Our approach</div>
        <h2 class="text-display-3 text-white">What we did, in order</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="space-y-6 text-lg text-[#a0a0a0] leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          We followed the VITAL framework — fix the lowest-scoring dimensions first, then
          compound on the wins. Here\'s the 90-day execution plan we shipped.
        </p>
        <div class="card p-6">
          <div class="eyebrow mb-3">Phase 1: Foundation (Weeks 1-4)</div>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-base">
            <li class="flex gap-3"><i class="ph-bold ph-check text-[var(--color-brand)] mt-1 shrink-0"></i>Rebuilt the homepage with a clear value proposition above the fold</li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><i class="ph-bold ph-check text-[var(--color-brand)] mt-1 shrink-0"></i>Added Product, Organization, and FAQ schema markup sitewide</li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><i class="ph-bold ph-check text-[var(--color-brand)] mt-1 shrink-0"></i>Set up GA4 with proper event taxonomy and conversion tracking</li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><i class="ph-bold ph-check text-[var(--color-brand)] mt-1 shrink-0"></i>Installed Meta, Google, and TikTok retargeting pixels</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="card p-6">
          <div class="eyebrow mb-3">Phase 2: Conversion (Weeks 5-8)</div>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-base">
            <li class="flex gap-3"><i class="ph-bold ph-check text-[var(--color-brand)] mt-1 shrink-0"></i>Reduced checkout from 7 steps to 3, fields from 14 to 6</li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><i class="ph-bold ph-check text-[var(--color-brand)] mt-1 shrink-0"></i>A/B tested 6 CTA variations — winning variant: "Find your fit"</li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><i class="ph-bold ph-check text-[var(--color-brand)] mt-1 shrink-0"></i>Added live chat with a 90-second first-response SLA</li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><i class="ph-bold ph-check text-[var(--color-brand)] mt-1 shrink-0"></i>Built a 4-step welcome nurture sequence for new email subscribers</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="card p-6">
          <div class="eyebrow mb-3">Phase 3: GEO & Scale (Weeks 9-13)</div>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-base">
            <li class="flex gap-3"><i class="ph-bold ph-check text-[var(--color-brand)] mt-1 shrink-0"></i>Restructured 12 category pages for AI-overview citation</li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><i class="ph-bold ph-check text-[var(--color-brand)] mt-1 shrink-0"></i>Built a knowledge graph presence via Wikidata and Wikipedia citations</li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><i class="ph-bold ph-check text-[var(--color-brand)] mt-1 shrink-0"></i>Set up weekly monitoring for ChatGPT, Perplexity, and Gemini citations</li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><i class="ph-bold ph-check text-[var(--color-brand)] mt-1 shrink-0"></i>Rolled out winning CRO variants to 100% of traffic</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- TIMELINE -->
  <section class="section-y bg-[#0c0c0c]">
    <div class="container-wide">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mb-10">
        <div class="eyebrow mb-4">Timeline</div>
        <h2 class="text-display-2 text-white">
          13 weeks from<br/>
          <span class="text-gradient-brand">audit to scale</span>
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="space-y-4">
        {timeline.map((t) => (
          <div class="card p-6 grid md:grid-cols-[120px_1fr_2fr] gap-6">
            <div class="text-xs mono text-[var(--color-brand)]">{t.week}</div>
            <div>
              <div class="font-bold text-white">{t.phase}</div>
            </div>
            <p class="text-sm text-[#888] leading-relaxed">{t.desc}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- RESULTS -->
  <section class="section-y">
    <div class="container-wide">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mb-10">
        <div class="eyebrow mb-4">The results</div>
        <h2 class="text-display-2 text-white">
          Real numbers, <span class="text-gradient-brand">measured honestly</span>
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-12">
        <div class="card p-6">
          <div class="text-3xl font-black text-white mb-2">+187%</div>
          <div class="font-bold text-white mb-2">Organic traffic</div>
          <p class="text-sm text-[#888] leading-relaxed mb-3">Measured via Google Search Console, comparing Jan 2025 to Jun 2025. Driven by 23 new ranking keywords in top 3 positions and 89 new keywords on page 1.</p>
          <div class="text-xs mono text-[#666]">Verified: GSC, SEMrush, Ahrefs cross-reference</div>
        </div>
        <div class="card p-6">
          <div class="text-3xl font-black text-white mb-2">4.2x</div>
          <div class="font-bold text-white mb-2">Lead-to-customer</div>
          <p class="text-sm text-[#888] leading-relaxed mb-3">From 2.1% to 8.8% conversion rate. Driven by checkout simplification, CTA testing, and live chat. Same traffic volume, 4x the customers.</p>
          <div class="text-xs mono text-[#666]">Verified: GA4 + HubSpot attribution</div>
        </div>
        <div class="card p-6">
          <div class="text-3xl font-black text-white mb-2">£2.1M</div>
          <div class="font-bold text-white mb-2">Attributed pipeline</div>
          <p class="text-sm text-[#888] leading-relaxed mb-3">Sum of qualified opportunities sourced from organic search in the 6-month measurement window. Verified via multi-touch attribution in HubSpot.</p>
          <div class="text-xs mono text-[#666]">Verified: HubSpot multi-touch attribution</div>
        </div>
        <div class="card p-6">
          <div class="text-3xl font-black text-white mb-2">+312%</div>
          <div class="font-bold text-white mb-2">AI-overview citations</div>
          <p class="text-sm text-[#888] leading-relaxed mb-3">From 8 monthly mentions to 33 monthly mentions across ChatGPT, Perplexity, and Gemini. Tracked weekly via custom monitoring tool.</p>
          <div class="text-xs mono text-[#666]">Verified: Custom monitoring tool, weekly reports</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <blockquote class="card p-8 border-l-4 border-[var(--color-brand)] max-w-3xl">
        <p class="text-xl text-white leading-relaxed mb-4 italic">
          "Sanjeev\'s team rebuilt our entire acquisition engine. We\'re now showing up in
          AI search results ahead of brands 10x our size. The VITAL audit told us exactly
          where the leaks were, and the 90-day plan prioritized the fixes that mattered."
        </p>
        <div class="text-sm">
          <div class="font-bold text-white">Sarah Mitchell</div>
          <div class="text-[#888]">CEO, Tutti Rouge</div>
        </div>
      </blockquote>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- WHAT WE LEARNED -->
  <section class="section-y bg-[#0c0c0c]">
    <div class="container-wide max-w-3xl">
      <div class="eyebrow mb-4">What we learned</div>
      <h2 class="text-display-2 text-white mb-6">
        The takeaway
      </h2>
      <div class="prose prose-invert max-w-none space-y-4 text-lg text-[#a0a0a0] leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          Tutti Rouge is a textbook example of a business with a great product and a leaky
          funnel. The brand was strong, the inventory was real, the customers existed — but
          the website was hemorrhaging conversions and invisible in the new search landscape.
        </p>
        <p>
          The biggest win wasn\'t any single tactic. It was the prioritization — knowing that
          fixing the 32-point Transition score would produce more revenue than ranking for 20
          more keywords. That\'s the discipline the VITAL framework brings.
        </p>
        <p>
          The GEO work is what sets Tutti Rouge apart now. 18 months ago, no one in fashion
          resale was optimizing for ChatGPT citations. Today they\'re being referenced in
          answers to "where can I buy authenticated pre-owned designer pieces in the UK" — and
          their competitors are playing catch-up.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="section-y relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="orb-red top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2"></div>
    <div class="container-wide relative text-center">
      <h2 class="text-display-2 text-white mb-6">
        Could this be <span class="text-gradient-brand">your business?</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-[#a0a0a0] mb-10 max-w-xl mx-auto">
        Find out with a free VITAL audit. 90 seconds. Real numbers.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-4">
        <a href="/vital-audit" class="btn btn-primary btn-large">
          <i class="ph-bold ph-lightning"></i>
          Get my free VITAL audit
        </a>
        <a href="/work" class="btn btn-ghost btn-large">
          Read another case study
          <i class="ph-bold ph-arrow-up-right"></i>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
